<title>CHINA: TRADING IN IWAI'S INTL SHARES SUSPENDED.</title>
<headline>TRADING IN IWAI'S INTL SHARES SUSPENDED.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in Iwai's International Holdings Ltd shares was suspended on Monday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said.</p>
<p>The stock last traded at HK$1.67.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
